---
title: Case File assembly and GitHub delivery · delivery resolves before the core is sealed
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant ctl as Client outputs · control plane
  participant sol as GPT-6.1 Sol
  participant gh as GitHub App
  participant dash as Client dashboard
  ctl->>sol: Frozen, source-linked context bundle
  sol-->>ctl: Typed draft fields
  ctl->>ctl: Verify content, freeze findings
  opt Validated implementation
    ctl->>ctl: Reserve Case File identity and stable authenticated URL
    ctl->>gh: Preflight
    ctl->>gh: Branch, commit, and draft PR with hidden marker
    ctl->>gh: Reconcile and verify exact branch and head
    alt Verified
      gh-->>ctl: Delivery identities
      ctl->>ctl: Persist delivery identities
    else Delivery blocker
      ctl->>ctl: Become the blocked variant, verify again
    end
  end
  ctl->>ctl: Set ready, compute immutable core digest
  ctl->>dash: Publish sealed Case File
